# Project

Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repo root. Load `.cursor/skills/` when the task matches:

- Detection / gestures / logcat / accessibility → `plus-key-detection`
- ADB / READ_LOGS / on-device debug → `device-testing`
- APK build / install / CI release → `ship-debug-apk`

Never hard-code Plus Key identity. Logcat is first-class on Nord 5. Do not run `matchesPlusKey` on logcat events. Keep accessibility `onKeyEvent` thin. Do not commit OnePlus Sans fonts or add analytics.
